[{"answer":"Did you make notes while you were watching the performances of Romeo and Juliet, Gemma?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I did. I found it quite hard though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I kept getting too involved in the play.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Me too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I ended up not taking notes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I wrote down my impressions when I got home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you mind if I check a few things with you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/7.mp3"},{"answer":"In case I've missed anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/8.mp3"},{"answer":"And I've also got some questions about our assignment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/9.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it's good to talk things through.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I may have missed things too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/11.mp3"},{"answer":"OK great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/12.mp3"},{"answer":"So first of all,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure how much information we should include in our reviews.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. Well, I don't think we need to describe what happens.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Especially as Romeo and Juliet is one of Shakespeare's most well-known plays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, everyone knows the story.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/17.mp3"},{"answer":"In an essay we'd focus on the poetry and Shakespeare's use of imagery etc.,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/18.mp3"},{"answer":"but that isn't really relevant in a review.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/19.mp3"},{"answer":"We're supposed to focus on how effective this particular production is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/20.mp3"},{"answer":"We should say what made it a success or a failure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/21.mp3"},{"answer":"And part of that means talking about the emotional impact the performance had on us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that's important.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/23-2023-01-13-10-41-43.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/24.mp3"},{"answer":"And we should definitely mention how well the director handled important bits of the play -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/25.mp3"},{"answer":"like when Romeo climbs onto Juliet's balcony.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/26.mp3"},{"answer":"And the fight between Mercutio and Tybalt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/28.mp3"},{"answer":"It would also be interesting to mention the theatre space","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and how the director used it","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/30.mp3"},{"answer":"but I don't think we'll have space in 800 words.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/31.mp3"},{"answer":"No. OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/32-2024-01-30-21-31-14.mp3"},{"answer":"That all sounds quite straightforward.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/33.mp3"},{"answer":"So what about The Emporium Theatre's production of the play?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought some things worked really well but there were some problems too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. What about the set, for example?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it was visually really stunning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd say that was probably the most memorable thing about this production.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/38-2023-01-13-10-44-47.mp3"},{"answer":"You're right. The set design was really amazing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/39.mp3"},{"answer":"but actually I have seen similar ideas used in other productions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/40-2023-01-13-10-45-28.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the lighting?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of the scenes were so dimly lit it was quite hard to see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't dislike it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/43.mp3"},{"answer":"It helped to change the mood of the quieter scenes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/44.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a good point.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/45.mp3"},{"answer":"What did you think of the costumes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/46.mp3"},{"answer":"I was a bit surprised by the contemporary dress, I must say.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah - I think it worked well, but I had assumed it would be more conventional.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Me too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I liked the music at the beginning and I thought the musicians were brilliant,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/50.mp3"},{"answer":"but I thought they were wasted because the music didn't have much impact in Acts 2 and 3.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes - that was a shame.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/52.mp3"},{"answer":"One problem with this production was that the actors didn't deliver the lines that well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/53.mp3"},{"answer":"They were speaking too fast.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/54.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a problem I agree,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/55.mp3"},{"answer":"but I thought it was because they weren't speaking loudly enough,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/56.mp3"},{"answer":"especially at key points in the play.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/57.mp3"},{"answer":"I actually didn't have a problem with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/58.mp3"},{"answer":"It's been an interesting experience watching different versions of Romeo and Juliet, hasn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Definitely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/60.mp3"},{"answer":"It's made me realise how relevant the play still is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. I mean a lot's changed since Shakespeare's time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/62-2024-11-02-01-30-26.mp3"},{"answer":"but in many ways nothing's changed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/63.mp3"},{"answer":"There are always disagreements and tension between teenagers and their parents.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's something all young people can relate to -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/65.mp3"},{"answer":"more than the violence and the extreme emotions in the play.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/66.mp3"},{"answer":"How did you find watching it in translation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Really interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/68.mp3"},{"answer":"I expected to find it more challenging, but I could follow the story pretty well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I stopped worrying about not being able to understand all the words and focused on the actors' expressions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/70.mp3"},{"answer":"The ending was pretty powerful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. That somehow intensified the emotion for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you know Shakespeare's been translated into more languages than any other writer?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/73.mp3"},{"answer":"What's the reason for his international appeal, do you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I was reading that it's because his plays are about basic themes that people everywhere are familiar with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, and they can also be understood on different levels.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/76.mp3"},{"answer":"The characters have such depth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Right - which allows directors to experiment and find new angles.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/78.mp3"},{"answer":"That's really important...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-2-section-3-2022-12-22-23-08-18/79.mp3"}]
